NAME NOT SET — this is the committed placeholder, never the built artefact.

The real app/wizexercise.txt is generated by `just build` from WIZ_EXERCISE_NAME
and is gitignored, so the image carries the name and the repository does not.

Set it in .envrc.local (gitignored):

    export WIZ_EXERCISE_NAME="Your Name"

`just build` fails loudly if it is unset — shipping this placeholder inside the
image would fail the exercise requirement silently, which is worse than not
building at all.
